# Each app has its own env file (separate settings per module):
#   apps/api-server/.env        ← copy from apps/api-server/.env.example   (ACI_* variables)
#   apps/dashboard/.env.local   ← copy from apps/dashboard/.env.example    (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL)
#
# Minimum to run the central server:
#   ACI_DATABASE_URL   Supabase PostgreSQL connection string
#   ACI_JWT_SECRET     random 32+ char secret (required in production)
# Optional:
#   ACI_REDIS_URL      leave empty to run without Redis
